version: 1.0
license: Artistic-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/bradleyalexward/CorNetto"
url: "https://github.com/bradleyalexward/CorNetto"
abstract: "CorNetto is an R package for knowledge-guided multi-omic correlation network analysis, including group-specific correlation networks, prior-guided differential correlation testing, node-level rewiring scores, and permutation validation. Leïla Belkhir and Laure Elens are joint senior authors."
